---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icons from '../../components/Icons.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Online-only nutrition services | NutritionColours"
  description="Current status and safety information for NutritionColours remote services by phone, WhatsApp, video, email and audio. No physical office or walk-in clinic is represented."
  canonicalUrl="/services/online-nutrition"
  noindex={true}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Online services', path: '/services/online-nutrition' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline">Home</a></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200">Online services</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700/60 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/50 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300">
      <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Service Status &middot; Active Governance Verification
    </div>

    <h1 class="mt-4 text-fluid-hero font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-50 brand-font">
      Online-only nutrition services
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-5">
      NutritionColours provides educational and consultative services remotely. We do not operate a customer-facing physical office, walk-in clinic, diagnostic laboratory, or geographic branch network.
    </p>

    <!-- 4-Channel Remote Grid -->
    <section class="mt-12 space-y-4" aria-labelledby="channels-heading">
      <h2 id="channels-heading" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100 brand-font">
        Remote communication channels
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
        Communication channels remain under administrative setup. A listed method does not guarantee that a clinical consultation is currently open for booking:
      </p>

      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 pt-2">
        <div class="card-interactive rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-5 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">Channel 01</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Video Consult</h3>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">End-to-end encrypted remote video session.</p>
          <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/80">
            Pending Review
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-5 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">Channel 02</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Telephonic Desk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Audio call for scheduled client check-ins.</p>
          <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/80">
            Pending Review
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-5 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">Channel 03</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">WhatsApp Desk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Administrative reminders and general logistics.</p>
          <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-bold text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700">
            Logistics Only
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-5 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">Channel 04</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Email Desk</h3>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Editorial inquiries and governance feedback.</p>
          <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/80">
            Active Desk
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Details Under Verification Alert -->
    <section class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/60 bg-amber-50/70 dark:bg-amber-950/30 p-7 md:p-8 text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200 space-y-3" aria-labelledby="verification-heading">
      <h2 id="verification-heading" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-100 brand-font">Details still being verified</h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
        Clinical practitioner credentials, professional scopes, eligible practice jurisdictions, hourly rates, cancellation terms, privacy handling protocols, and secure intake workflows are currently undergoing independent legal and clinical audit. Do not infer any service agreement from third-party search listings.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300">
        This page will remain outside search indexing until the complete service framework is independently certified.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Emergency & Urgent Care Boundary -->
    <section class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-900/60 bg-rose-50/70 dark:bg-rose-950/30 p-7 md:p-8 text-rose-950 dark:text-rose-200 space-y-4" aria-labelledby="safety-heading">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-rose-200/80 dark:bg-rose-900/60 text-rose-900 dark:text-rose-100 border border-rose-300 dark:border-rose-800 text-sm font-black" aria-hidden="true">
          <Icons name="alert-triangle" size={16} />
        </span>
        <h2 id="safety-heading" class="text-xl font-black text-rose-950 dark:text-rose-100 brand-font">Privacy & emergency care boundary</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
        <li>Do not send private medical records, laboratory panels, or acute symptoms through unencrypted email or messaging apps.</li>
        <li>This website and its administrative contact desks do not provide acute emergency services or diagnostic triage.</li>
        <li>For medical emergencies or sudden clinical symptoms, immediately contact your local emergency response service or emergency hospital facility.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-bold">
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-900 dark:bg-emerald-700 px-6 py-3 text-white hover:bg-emerald-800 dark:hover:bg-emerald-800 transition-colors">
        General contact
      </a>
      <a href="/legal/privacy" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 px-6 py-3 text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors">
        Privacy notice
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
